# Wye never runs sensible-browser. The name is in the loop guard's list of
# openers (crates/wye-desktop/src/loop_guard.rs, OPENERS): programs that would
# hand a link straight back to the default browser, which Wye refuses to
# launch. Lintian sees the string in the binaries and assumes a call.
wye: missing-depends-on-sensible-utils sensible-browser [usr/bin/*]
